{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local cohomology change of rings local cohomology change of rings","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","fileName":"Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local Cohomology Change of Rings","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-13 20:25\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"local cohomology change of rings local cohomology change of rings","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","fileName":"Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Local Cohomology Change of Rings","heading":"Local Cohomology Change of Rings","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"For a Noetherian R-algebra S, an ideal I of R, and an S-module M, local cohomology computed over R with support in I agrees with local cohomology over S with support in the extended ideal IS.\n\nThe result lets the ambient ring change without changing the supported cohomological information. Under flat base change, local cohomology also tensors compatibly with the new ring.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local Cohomology and Rees Algebra","commutativealgebra.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Local Cohomology Change of Rings.md"